      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 4.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Good afternoon. Have a seat and we'll begin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.77,
      "end_seconds": 10.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Yeah, thanks, doctor. It's been a long few days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.58,
      "end_seconds": 14.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "In your own words, what's happened?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.44,
      "end_seconds": 19.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I wanted to get nausea looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.13,
      "end_seconds": 22.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.73,
      "end_seconds": 35.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Almost there..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.14,
      "end_seconds": 63.05,
      "duration_seconds": 10.91,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 111 beats a minute, temp 36.6 degrees, BP is 135 over 84, SpO2 98 percent on room air. Roughly when did it start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.36,
      "end_seconds": 66.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Probably about four days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.6,
      "end_seconds": 71.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.19,
      "end_seconds": 74.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Honestly, every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.74,
      "end_seconds": 89.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "How about previous kidney stones?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.3,
      "end_seconds": 93.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Nope, no previous kidney stones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.2,
      "end_seconds": 101.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever, burning when passing urine or difficulty passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.88,
      "end_seconds": 104.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.81,
      "end_seconds": 109.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.22,
      "end_seconds": 112.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.81,
      "end_seconds": 117.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.7,
      "end_seconds": 122.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.17,
      "end_seconds": 128.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.29,
      "end_seconds": 131.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.56,
      "end_seconds": 137.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.03,
      "end_seconds": 141.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "My father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.94,
      "end_seconds": 148.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.85,
      "end_seconds": 153.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "No, uh, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.38,
      "end_seconds": 159.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.58,
      "end_seconds": 163.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.17,
      "end_seconds": 179.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.35,
      "end_seconds": 183.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.42,
      "end_seconds": 187.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "How about exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.13,
      "end_seconds": 192.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Not really, I don't get much exercise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.34,
      "end_seconds": 195.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Do you live alone?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.18,
      "end_seconds": 200.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Yes, I live on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.89,
      "end_seconds": 205.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Let's do the physical part now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.64,
      "end_seconds": 218.34,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.57,
      "end_seconds": 221.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.01,
      "end_seconds": 238.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "There's tenderness in the right loin when I tap, and your tummy is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.92,
      "end_seconds": 250.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Okay, finished. Okay, thinking it through, the most likely explanation is a kidney stone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.17,
      "end_seconds": 273.93,
      "duration_seconds": 9.76,
      "text": "I think kidney function tests makes sense here, for renal colic. Let's book a urine test to look into flank pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.54,
      "end_seconds": 278.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "How long does that take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.54,
      "end_seconds": 287.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "The treatment will be paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days. It's for pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.75,
      "end_seconds": 293.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Okay, and I take that after food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.57,
      "end_seconds": 314.7,
      "duration_seconds": 18.13,
      "text": "Drink three litres of water a day and try to strain your urine so we can catch the stone if it passes. Do get help quickly if you get a fever or can't pass urine at all. Come back after the scan."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.38,
      "end_seconds": 318.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Alright, I'll put it in my diary."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.37,
      "end_seconds": 323.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.17,
      "end_seconds": 327.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    },
